# ── Build output & dependencies — never belong in a build context ──
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.angular
**/bin
**/obj

# ── Editor / OS noise ──
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/Thumbs.db
**/.DS_Store

# ── Docker's own files ──
**/Dockerfile
**/.dockerignore
docker-compose*.yml

# ── Backups created before containerising ──
**/*.bak

# ── Local secrets must be injected at runtime, never baked into an image ──
**/appsettings.*.local.json
**/*.pfx
